        "fallback_height": 1500,
        "image_position": "left",
        "heading": "<p>Hair loss and scalp <em>health</em></p>",
        "subheading": "Start with an answer, not a product.",
        "intro": "<p>If your hair is shedding, thinning, breaking, or has simply never grown past a certain point, there is a reason. Most people are handed a shampoo and told to be patient. That is not a plan.</p><p>At the Hair Lab your scalp is examined under magnification and your history is taken properly. You leave knowing what is happening, why it is happening, and what will genuinely help.</p>",
        "secondary_heading": "",
        "secondary_body": "",
        "footnote": "",
        "link_label": "Book an appointment",
        "link_url": ""
      }
