        "heading": "<p>Colour</p>",
        "subheading": "Colour that grows out beautifully.",
        "intro": "<p>The mark of good colour is not the first week. It is week eight, when the regrowth line is soft instead of a shelf, and you have not started avoiding the mirror.</p>",
        "secondary_heading": "How colour is priced, realistically",
        "secondary_body": "<p>Every colour service is quoted on a standard measure of product. If your hair is thicker, longer, or the regrowth is further out than usual, it takes more colour, and the extra is weighed and added at the counter through our Vish scales.</p><p>It means you pay for the product that went on your head, not a flat fee that quietly overcharges everyone with short hair. You will always be told before we start.</p>",
        "footnote": "",
